WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.580
Welcome to Model architecture: categories, capability areas and practice areas. In this lesson, we explore this purpose: Learn how categories, capability areas, practice areas and practices relate..

2
00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:26.780
Consider this scenario. A team claims full CMMI coverage because it has listed all PA acronyms in a spreadsheet. First understand the problem before producing documentation.

3
00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:37.150
Start with two steps: Identify the organizational context. Then Choose the applicable model view. Each step should be explained and evidenced.

4
00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:48.860
Continue with Navigate category → CA → PA → practice. Then Connect a practice to observed work. Verify the results against the intended outcome.

5
00:00:48.860 --> 00:01:00.120
Stronger evidence looks like this: Evidence of actual implementation. Weaker evidence would be: An unverified claim. Triangulate independent sources.

6
00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:14.370
Now your turn. Review four documents and two interviews, identify inconsistencies and complete the mastery challenge. This video is an independent teaching explanation, not official CMMI model wording.
